{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cuzsn-koEHczr9ycfWyPMQ?scene=1&click_id=6","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:57.959804+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cuzsn-koEHczr9ycfWyPMQ?scene=1&click_id=6","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><span>澳</span></span><span><span>大</span></span><span><span>工</span></span><span><span>商</span></span><span><span>管</span></span><span><span>理</span></span><span><span>學院</span></span></section><p><span><span><span><span><span>學</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>院</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>消</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>息</span></span></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span><span><span><span>澳門大學工商管理學院</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年學術夏令營火熱招募中！</span> </span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OfgCdUlWR0nm6ciawMnZ5g4ESmJ1rUR9b9TfVwX2TSjAtcka6rHmd8oaHzMOWCmyhOdstIBHaDxwgR6Pk5LMhbG0vzRxbEKgCEImfiawNdaEQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p><span><span>一、學</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>簡介</span></span></p><p><span>工商管理學院（FBA）是澳門大學歷史最悠久的學院之一，在教學、科研、國際認可及產學合作方面均具領先地位，並展現獨特的亞洲區域特色。</span></p><p><span>澳門大學位於粵港澳大灣區核心位置——中國最具活力與國際化的經濟區域之一。作為大灣區的重要商學院，FBA 致力培養具國際視野的商業與管理領袖。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>本院教師均經全球招聘，許多為國際知名學者，具備豐富的碩博士研究生指導經驗。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>二、</span></span><span><span>課程</span></span><span><span>簡介</span></span></p><p><span><span>哲學博士學位（工商管理）課程緊貼全球高等教育發展趨勢及社會需求，積極推動教研融合，並圍繞澳門及大灣區產業發展的戰略方向，提供參與跨學科、跨領域研究的機會，培養研究生成為具備競爭力、能夠解決相關領域複雜</span></span><span><span>問題的高層次專業人才。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>本</span></span><span><span>課程</span></span><span><span>為</span></span><span><span>全日制博士學位課程</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>標</span></span><span><span>準修讀期為</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>年，涵蓋課堂學習、學術研究及博士論文</span></span><span><span>撰寫。</span></span><span><span>優</span></span><span><span>秀</span></span><span><span>學生有機</span></span><span><span>會</span></span><span><span>於入學時獲頒</span><b><span><span>獎</span></span></b></span><b><span><span><span>學金</span></span></span></b><span><span><span>，</span></span><b><span><span>每月可達澳</span></span></b></span><b><span><span><span>門</span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>元</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>20,000</span></span></b><span><span>，為期</span><b><span><span>最長四年</span></span></b></span><span><span>。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><b><span><span><span>三、夏令營簡介</span></span></span></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><b><span>📅</span></b><b><span></span></b><b><span><span><span>活動時間：</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span><span>–</span></span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><b><span><span>📍</span></span></b><b><span><span><span>活動地點：澳門大學工商管理學院</span></span></span></b></p><p><b><span><span>🗣</span></span></b><b><span><span><span>活動語言：英語</span></span></span></b></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>參與夏令營的同學將有機會：</span></span><span></span></p><p><span>✨</span><span><span>深入了解</span></span><span> FBA </span><span><span>的各學系與博士課程</span></span></p><p><span>✨</span><span><span>與知名教授面對面交流前沿科研課題</span></span></p><p><span>✨</span><span><span>與在讀研究生分享升學與科研體驗</span></span></p><p><span>✨</span><span><span>團隊形式參與科研小項目並進行成果彙報</span></span></p><p><span>✨</span><span><span>參觀校園與學院科研設施</span></span></p><p><span>✨</span><span><span>體驗澳大書院住宿生活</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>日程安排：</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span><span>日（星期日）</span></span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>書院住宿登記、領取</span></span></span><span><span><span>註</span></span></span><span><span><span>册資料。</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span><span>日（星期一）</span></span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>致歡迎詞、學系簡介、課程簡介、</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>課題海報分享、項目組隊、校園導賞。</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span><span>日（星期二）</span></span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>教授科研項目分享、模擬課堂、</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>與教授面談、晚宴。</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span><span>日（星期三）</span></span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>項目彙報、書院退房。</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span><span>👉優秀營員將在博士招生中獲得優先考慮！</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>四、申請要求</span></span></p><p><span><span>本次夏令營面向</span><b><span>計劃於</span></b></span><b><span>2027</span><span><span>年秋季報讀</span></span><span>FBA</span><span><span>博士課程</span></span></b><span><span>的同學。</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>歡迎以下同學報名：</span></span><span></span>